{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：16:47 2026-05-29 HKT<br/>發佈時間：16:47 2026-05-29 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：16:47 2026-05-29 HKT</p><p>葉楚航常常從化、香港兩邊走處理廄務，日前航哥北上從化檢視旗下馬匹，晚上宴請當地馬房員工一頓海鮮晚餐，為眾人打一打氣，齊心合力爭取好成績。席間航哥感謝香港及從化兩地的一班好員工，及整個馬房團隊所付出的努力。</p><p>（相片來源：葉楚航提供）</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2b3ca9debaabd6bb1cf2fdfc293f3981/2026-05/0c50e007-9e1b-46f8-ad24-060a284dab1e_0.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0415b98b00a3df41f16c2f86abffa9ef/2026-05/60f16fcd-963f-4947-a628-cfa2f4256674_0.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/130ad53b51358c4ba7501b8f05205a3e/2026-05/c1880558-60b3-4c10-bd11-1ec680b019b1_0.jpg\"/><p>陳嘉甜<br/> </p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-29T08:59:30.723313+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":202,"images":3,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}